      "content": "Core REST API for Jupyter Server, the backend that powers Jupyter Notebook, JupyterLab, and other Jupyter web applications. Provides endpoints for managing kernels, sessions, contents (notebooks and files), terminals, kernel specifications, configuration, and server status.\n\nContact Support:\n Name: Jupyter Project\n Email: jupyter@googlegroups.com",
